BLUSH AND BLOOM

Company Name: Blush and Bloom
Company Vision: To offer personalized, high-quality makeup services that enhance natural beauty and create memorable looks for every occasion.
Company Tagline: "By Neha Gupta"

WEBSITE STRUCTURE:

1. Home Page:
   - Hero section with stunning makeup transformation showcase
   - Brief introduction to Blush and Bloom's philosophy and expertise
   - Featured services with quick links
   - Testimonials carousel from satisfied clients
   - Instagram feed integration showing latest work
   - Call-to-action for bookings

2. Portfolio (Gallery):
   a. Bridal:
      - Categorized by style (Traditional, Modern, Minimalist, Cultural)
      - Before/After transformations
      - Detailed views of specific techniques (eyes, lips, etc.)
   
   b. Pre-wedding:
      - Engagement shoots
      - Themed photoshoots
      - Destination pre-wedding looks
   
   c. Custom:
      - Special occasions (Parties, Galas, Proms)
      - Creative/Editorial makeup
      - Celebrity-inspired looks

3. Services:
   a. Event-based Services:
      - Bridal packages (details, pricing, what's included)
      - Special occasion makeup
      - Group bookings (bridal party, special events)
      - Add-ons (lash application, touch-up kits)
   
   b. Subscription Services:
      - Weekly membership benefits
      - Monthly membership benefits
      - Loyalty program details
      - Special perks for subscribers (priority booking, discounts on products)

4. About & Contact:
   a. About section:
      - Founder's story and expertise
      - Meet the team (if applicable)
      - Makeup philosophy and approach
      - Products and brands used
   
   b. Contact form:
      - Name, email, phone number
      - Event date
      - Service interested in
      - Additional notes/requirements
      - Preferred contact method
      - Upload reference images (optional)

5. Blog/Tips Section:
   - Makeup tutorials
   - Skincare advice
   - Seasonal makeup trends
   - Product recommendations

TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS:

Frontend:
- React.js with Next.js framework for SEO optimization
- Styled-components for consistent styling
- Framer Motion for smooth animations and transitions
- Responsive design for all devices (mobile-first approach)
- Lazy loading for image-heavy gallery sections
- Image compression and optimization for fast loading

Backend:
- Python FastAPI for RESTful API development
- PostgreSQL database for client information and booking details
- Secure authentication system for admin dashboard
- Automated email responses for form submissions
- Image processing pipeline for portfolio uploads
- Google Analytics integration for visitor tracking

Image Management:
- Separate folders structure: /portfolios/{category}/{subcategory}/
- Automated image optimization and resizing upon upload
- EXIF data removal for privacy
- Watermarking option for portfolio images
- CDN integration for faster image delivery

Booking System:
- Interactive calendar for availability checking
- Deposit payment processing
- Automated appointment reminders
- Cancellation/rescheduling options

Admin Dashboard:
- Content management system for easy portfolio updates
- Client database with search and filter capabilities
- Booking management interface
- Analytics and reporting tools